WEBVTT

﻿1


00:00:00.876 --> 00:00:03.002
[♪ soft music playing]


00:00:25.901 --> 00:00:27.987
[birds chirping]


00:00:31.323 --> 00:00:33.325
[boy panting]


00:00:38.455 --> 00:00:39.874
[BOY] This is really bad!


00:00:39.915 --> 00:00:41.291
I'm a goner!


00:00:43.084 --> 00:00:44.336
[exclaims]


00:00:46.755 --> 00:00:48.007
[monster growls]


00:00:48.047 --> 00:00:49.591
[boy pants]


00:00:54.013 --> 00:00:55.806
[knights grunt]


00:00:55.848 --> 00:00:56.932
[KNIGHT 1] Hey!


00:00:57.725 --> 00:00:59.560
[♪ tense music playing]


00:01:01.186 --> 00:01:02.312
[KNIGHT 1] Shit!


00:01:02.354 --> 00:01:03.397
The fuath--


00:01:03.438 --> 00:01:04.982
O Great Zelkoff, hear me.


00:01:06.817 --> 00:01:09.403
[boy pants]


00:01:09.444 --> 00:01:11.780
What the heck
is she doing over here?


00:01:11.947 --> 00:01:14.366
Come on, let's go. Come on!


00:01:15.993 --> 00:01:17.452
[monster growls]


00:01:20.121 --> 00:01:21.623
[monsters munching]


00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:25.544
[KNIGHT 1]
I must catch the coffin thief!


00:01:25.586 --> 00:01:28.505
[MAN 1] No. We'll make
a run for it. Send the signal.


00:01:28.547 --> 00:01:31.842
[KNIGHT 1] Run? Like a coward?
But we swore to protect it.


00:01:34.595 --> 00:01:35.804
Oh, shit!


00:01:35.846 --> 00:01:37.305
This could be it for me!


00:01:37.347 --> 00:01:39.683
- [boy pants]
- [monster growls]


00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:46.105
[KNIGHT 1] It can't be!
You mean the Temple is--


00:01:49.192 --> 00:01:50.652
[KNIGHT 1] Please, help me!


00:01:50.694 --> 00:01:51.862
[screaming]


00:01:54.197 --> 00:01:55.323
[boy screams]


00:01:56.033 --> 00:01:57.952
[grunts]


00:02:01.496 --> 00:02:02.706
[groans]


00:02:03.457 --> 00:02:05.084
- [gasps]
- [monster growls]


00:02:10.672 --> 00:02:12.424
[gasps in fear]


00:02:14.927 --> 00:02:16.177
Xylo!


00:02:16.219 --> 00:02:18.513
Help me already!
It's gonna eat me!


00:02:18.555 --> 00:02:20.724
[♪ dramatic music playing]


00:02:22.893 --> 00:02:24.770
[grunts in effort]


00:02:30.149 --> 00:02:31.860
[monster growls]


00:02:53.172 --> 00:02:54.758
[boy screams]


00:02:54.925 --> 00:02:56.510
[boy pants]


00:02:56.593 --> 00:02:59.346
Stop moving!
You're gonna bleed out!


00:02:59.387 --> 00:03:01.056
It hurts. Let me die!


00:03:01.098 --> 00:03:02.891
You can have me
resurrected later!


00:03:02.933 --> 00:03:04.059
Shut your mouth!


00:03:04.101 --> 00:03:06.145
Like hell
I'll haul your corpse around.


00:03:06.311 --> 00:03:09.272
[BOY] I'm begging you!
I can't even use another body!


00:03:09.690 --> 00:03:11.525
I mean,
that's all they need to--


00:03:13.485 --> 00:03:15.904
Listen up. It's not that simple.


00:03:16.155 --> 00:03:19.616
Resurrecting a hero like us
means dragging their souls


00:03:19.658 --> 00:03:21.743
straight out of hell,
and jamming it back


00:03:21.785 --> 00:03:23.078
into their corpse.


00:03:23.453 --> 00:03:25.706
It takes a nasty toll
on your memory


00:03:25.747 --> 00:03:27.166
and sense of self.


00:03:27.248 --> 00:03:30.585
Have you died so many times
you forgot the price? Well?


00:03:30.669 --> 00:03:32.129
[breathes shakily]


00:03:33.338 --> 00:03:34.422
[Xylo sighs]


00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:37.258
[XYLO] In any case,
there is zero chance


00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:39.053
the Holy Knights
would even bother


00:03:39.094 --> 00:03:40.721
to retrieve your body.


00:03:44.599 --> 00:03:46.643
If you're so eager to die.


00:03:46.685 --> 00:03:47.895
[blows]


00:03:48.395 --> 00:03:51.732
The least you can do
is wait until I'm not watching.


00:03:55.443 --> 00:03:58.237
Get ready to pull
and brace yourself.


00:03:58.906 --> 00:04:00.657
[boy breathes shakily]


00:04:02.659 --> 00:04:05.787
[XYLO] You know what's coming,
so grit your teeth.


00:04:06.413 --> 00:04:07.539
[grunts]


00:04:08.247 --> 00:04:10.500
[screams in pain]


00:04:22.179 --> 00:04:23.388
[sighs]


00:04:23.430 --> 00:04:26.808
[XYLO] Well,
you royally screwed up, moron.


00:04:29.186 --> 00:04:30.269
Dotta.


00:04:30.311 --> 00:04:32.981
Get a handle
on those sticky fingers.


00:04:33.065 --> 00:04:34.608
[DOTTA] Couldn't help it.


00:04:34.816 --> 00:04:38.319
I just so happened to spot
the Holy Knights transport team.


00:04:38.445 --> 00:04:40.072
Besides, isn't it their fault


00:04:40.114 --> 00:04:41.990
for leaving the carriage
undefended?


00:04:42.032 --> 00:04:44.868
It would've been far easier
not to steal from them.


00:04:44.910 --> 00:04:48.580
I only told you to get eyes
on the faeries. That's it.


00:04:50.832 --> 00:04:52.333
[gulps]


00:04:55.629 --> 00:04:56.755
[DOTTA] Xylo.


00:04:58.423 --> 00:05:01.176
I saw a lot of faeries
out there.


00:05:01.843 --> 00:05:03.804
[XYLO] Yeah, we're up against


00:05:03.845 --> 00:05:06.014
a massive Demon Blight
this time.


00:05:06.056 --> 00:05:08.100
According
to Command Central's briefing,


00:05:08.142 --> 00:05:09.893
it's around 5,000.


00:05:09.977 --> 00:05:11.436
[stammering] Five thousand?


00:05:11.478 --> 00:05:13.772
They can't expect us
to hold that many at bay


00:05:13.814 --> 00:05:14.982
all by ourselves!


00:05:15.023 --> 00:05:16.150
[XYLO] They do.


00:05:16.399 --> 00:05:17.901
The Demon Blight


00:05:17.943 --> 00:05:20.821
will soon corrupt
this entire forest.


00:05:21.029 --> 00:05:22.239
We're here to help


00:05:22.281 --> 00:05:24.323
those pathetic holy knights
retreat.


00:05:24.365 --> 00:05:27.202
No choice.
And don't expect backup.


00:05:27.244 --> 00:05:28.327
[gasps]


00:05:29.454 --> 00:05:31.790
Don't get any funny ideas, either.


00:05:31.832 --> 00:05:32.833
Try to run away,


00:05:32.874 --> 00:05:34.876
and they'll blow your head
clean off.


00:05:36.377 --> 00:05:37.629
[DOTTA] It's fine.


00:05:37.671 --> 00:05:39.131
Why should I care?


00:05:39.173 --> 00:05:41.591
I'm a hero,
so I can just be resurrected


00:05:41.633 --> 00:05:42.926
if things go south.


00:05:42.968 --> 00:05:45.637
As long as there's a body,
whether it's mine


00:05:45.679 --> 00:05:47.264
or someone else's.


00:05:47.306 --> 00:05:49.308
[XYLO] You don't get it, do you?


00:05:49.850 --> 00:05:52.978
Every time you lose
another chunk of who you are,


00:05:53.145 --> 00:05:55.396
and before long,
you become little more


00:05:55.438 --> 00:05:57.107
than a walking corpse.


00:05:59.318 --> 00:06:00.944
I refuse.


00:06:01.820 --> 00:06:04.198
That will not be my fate.


00:06:06.700 --> 00:06:09.661
Heroes are tools
with no autonomy.


00:06:11.538 --> 00:06:12.747
[satisfied sigh]


00:06:12.956 --> 00:06:15.500
We're here
to carry out our missions.


00:06:16.375 --> 00:06:18.419
And that's all there is to it.


00:06:19.963 --> 00:06:22.132
Delusions won't save you.


00:06:22.632 --> 00:06:23.925
Let's get out of here.


00:06:23.967 --> 00:06:25.468
[Dotta groans]


00:06:25.510 --> 00:06:28.055
[XYLO] Can't sit idly by
while they tear apart the night.


00:06:28.096 --> 00:06:29.223
Huh?


00:06:29.556 --> 00:06:30.974
[insects chirping]


00:06:37.147 --> 00:06:39.149
What is this thing?


00:06:47.115 --> 00:06:48.909
[XYLO] Wait, is that... ?


00:06:49.284 --> 00:06:51.536
- Are you out of your mind?
- [Dotta gasps]


00:06:51.578 --> 00:06:52.913
What kind of crap is this?


00:06:52.954 --> 00:06:55.332
Stealing a coffin
and dragging it back here?


00:06:55.374 --> 00:06:57.751
Good question. I can explain.


00:06:57.792 --> 00:06:59.378
See, it looked real valuable,


00:06:59.418 --> 00:07:01.838
and one thing led to another,
as it does...


00:07:01.880 --> 00:07:04.132
So, anyway, I thought
it might come in handy,


00:07:04.174 --> 00:07:05.633
that's why I brought it along.


00:07:05.675 --> 00:07:07.886
[XYLO] Idiot!
Do you really think this junk


00:07:07.928 --> 00:07:09.470
was worth a faerie bite?


00:07:10.722 --> 00:07:13.392
You're kidding me. Dotta.


00:07:13.683 --> 00:07:15.352
This thing had better be empty.


00:07:15.434 --> 00:07:17.562
- [DOTTA] I don't know.
- [XYLO] You what?


00:07:17.604 --> 00:07:19.564
[DOTTA]
I mean, it seemed pretty heavy,


00:07:19.606 --> 00:07:21.024
while I was carrying it.


00:07:21.066 --> 00:07:23.442
[XYLO] Why in the hell
would you steal a corpse?


00:07:23.484 --> 00:07:25.153
Even for you,
that makes no sense.


00:07:25.195 --> 00:07:27.822
[DOTTA] What can I say?
It just happened, all right?


00:07:27.864 --> 00:07:29.824
I acted without even thinking.


00:07:29.866 --> 00:07:32.869
Anyway, that whole place
was already swarmed by faeries.


00:07:32.911 --> 00:07:34.037
[gasps]


00:07:34.079 --> 00:07:35.789
Stop talking,


00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:38.875
or I may kill you
before the faeries can.


00:07:39.293 --> 00:07:41.711
Wait, don't be hasty.
We can leave it here


00:07:41.753 --> 00:07:43.671
if we don't want it,
then come get it.


00:07:43.713 --> 00:07:45.090
If the knights are angry.


00:07:45.132 --> 00:07:47.592
- [Xylo sighs, grunts]
- [giggles]


00:07:47.884 --> 00:07:49.636
[insects chirping]


00:07:55.267 --> 00:07:57.185
[XYLO]
From the looks of this coffin,


00:07:57.227 --> 00:08:01.398
it's the body of a royal, noble,
or high ranking Holy Knight.


00:08:01.564 --> 00:08:03.066
If I'm lucky,


00:08:03.150 --> 00:08:05.819
it'll be one of the people
I've been wanting to knock out.


00:08:06.903 --> 00:08:08.780
[♪ angelic music playing]


00:08:08.822 --> 00:08:11.741
[DOTTA] Well, she looks like
someone important.


00:08:11.783 --> 00:08:13.076
[XYLO] She is.


00:08:13.118 --> 00:08:15.745
- [XYLO] And we're in trouble.
- [DOTTA] I figured.


00:08:15.787 --> 00:08:17.747
She's gotta be a princess.


00:08:17.789 --> 00:08:19.040
[XYLO] If only.


00:08:20.125 --> 00:08:22.336
She isn't even a human.


00:08:23.211 --> 00:08:25.839
That kid is a goddess.


00:08:26.047 --> 00:08:27.466
What do you mean?


00:08:27.506 --> 00:08:29.134
[XYLO] What I just said!


00:08:29.259 --> 00:08:30.969
You stole a damn goddess!


00:08:31.011 --> 00:08:32.595
That cannot be true.


00:08:32.679 --> 00:08:34.222
Aren't goddesses
a type of weapon


00:08:34.264 --> 00:08:36.933
created a long time ago
to fight demon lords?


00:08:36.975 --> 00:08:38.517
That's right.


00:08:38.559 --> 00:08:42.063
Humanity's last ray of hope.
Or that was the idea, anyway.


00:08:42.189 --> 00:08:45.317
I don't understand.
She looks like a little girl.


00:08:45.359 --> 00:08:47.068
But the goddesses
I've heard about


00:08:47.110 --> 00:08:49.237
were enormous,
whalelike creatures,


00:08:49.279 --> 00:08:50.405
or giant hunks of iron.


00:08:50.447 --> 00:08:51.530
[horn blaring]


00:08:51.572 --> 00:08:53.616
Time to move.
Leave her in the coffin.


00:08:53.658 --> 00:08:54.826
Right.


00:08:57.162 --> 00:08:58.497
[Dotta breathes shakily]


00:08:58.537 --> 00:09:01.082
[DOTTA] A hunting horn?
Think it's the knights?


00:09:01.124 --> 00:09:04.294
Judging by the loud volume,
it's a scouting party


00:09:04.336 --> 00:09:05.712
or flying column.


00:09:05.753 --> 00:09:08.507
Their status.
You can see them, can't you?


00:09:08.547 --> 00:09:09.674
[Dotta ponders]


00:09:10.425 --> 00:09:11.718
[DOTTA] Looks like...


00:09:11.926 --> 00:09:13.803
a band of fuath...


00:09:13.887 --> 00:09:15.013
and...


00:09:16.056 --> 00:09:18.225
people dead or dying.


00:09:18.850 --> 00:09:20.060
[knight 1 pants]


00:09:21.102 --> 00:09:22.229
[knight 1 grunts]


00:09:23.355 --> 00:09:24.731
Help me!


00:09:26.233 --> 00:09:27.775
[pants]


00:09:28.985 --> 00:09:30.569
[grunts]


00:09:31.279 --> 00:09:32.447
[yells fiercely]


00:09:34.157 --> 00:09:35.325
[gasps]


00:09:36.284 --> 00:09:37.702
[knight 2 screams]


00:09:38.328 --> 00:09:40.288
[KNIGHT 3]
Shit! There are too many!


00:09:40.663 --> 00:09:43.582
Hold the line, men,
no matter what happens!


00:09:45.293 --> 00:09:47.045
[knight 4 screams]


00:09:48.713 --> 00:09:49.964
[thud]


00:09:51.674 --> 00:09:54.135
[XYLO] It's spreading faster
than I expected.


00:09:54.177 --> 00:09:56.513
They would've been prepared
for faerie attacks,


00:09:56.555 --> 00:09:57.638
but nothing like this.


00:09:57.680 --> 00:09:59.349
I've heard enough! Let's go!


00:09:59.391 --> 00:10:02.769
We should hide somewhere
until it's over.


00:10:02.810 --> 00:10:05.272
[XYLO] There's still a chance
for some of them.


00:10:05.313 --> 00:10:06.398
[DOTTA] Huh?


00:10:06.773 --> 00:10:09.234
[XYLO] A few stubborn asses
who won't die.


00:10:09.276 --> 00:10:11.610
It's in our best interest
to save them.


00:10:11.652 --> 00:10:12.820
[DOTTA] Are you insane?


00:10:12.862 --> 00:10:14.739
How is dying
in our best interest?


00:10:14.781 --> 00:10:16.157
Remember the mission.


00:10:16.199 --> 00:10:18.452
Help the majority
of the knights escape.


00:10:18.493 --> 00:10:20.454
Every person we manage to save


00:10:20.495 --> 00:10:22.497
increases
our chances of success.


00:10:22.539 --> 00:10:24.332
- [DOTTA] Huh?
- [XYLO] We're fighting.


00:10:24.374 --> 00:10:25.708
I'll save 'em quickly.


00:10:26.042 --> 00:10:29.337
Before the sun sets,
we'll run down the cliff.


00:10:29.379 --> 00:10:31.465
- [GIRL] We're fighting!
- [gasps]


00:10:31.756 --> 00:10:33.300
[GIRL] I'll...


00:10:33.341 --> 00:10:34.509
save them.


00:10:37.762 --> 00:10:39.139
Wonderful!


00:10:40.014 --> 00:10:42.267
Such lovely words.


00:10:42.559 --> 00:10:45.270
There is no mistaking
that you are my knight.


00:10:45.312 --> 00:10:46.438
[grunts softly]


00:10:46.687 --> 00:10:48.315
[GIRL] A good start.


00:10:48.356 --> 00:10:50.733
I deem your efforts passable.


00:10:51.568 --> 00:10:53.528
It is your courage


00:10:53.945 --> 00:10:56.655
that has made you
worthy of a goddess.


00:10:56.697 --> 00:10:57.991
[knife clinks]


00:11:00.201 --> 00:11:02.454
[GIRL]
Is there not a battle afoot?


00:11:02.870 --> 00:11:04.289
And lo,


00:11:04.331 --> 00:11:06.874
'tis a battle to save
the precious lives of others.


00:11:06.916 --> 00:11:08.168
So be it.


00:11:08.209 --> 00:11:10.795
From a goddess, to her knight.


00:11:10.837 --> 00:11:13.548
Your victory
is henceforth guaranteed!


00:11:13.590 --> 00:11:15.925
[Xylo gasps]


00:11:15.967 --> 00:11:20.096
[GIRL] In that hour,
when all enemies lie lifeless,


00:11:20.138 --> 00:11:22.807
your voice
shall sing my praises.


00:11:23.099 --> 00:11:24.559
And your hand


00:11:24.601 --> 00:11:27.604
shall lavish pats upon my head!


00:11:27.646 --> 00:11:28.771
[Dotta gasps]


00:11:29.688 --> 00:11:30.773
[groans]


00:11:30.815 --> 00:11:33.234
You may pat away
to your heart's content!


00:11:33.276 --> 00:11:35.903
No amount of praise
could properly honor the majesty


00:11:35.945 --> 00:11:37.280
that is a goddess.


00:11:37.696 --> 00:11:39.491
I shall even permit you
to compose


00:11:39.533 --> 00:11:41.326
a song of veneration to me!


00:11:41.576 --> 00:11:43.036
[XYLO] Dauntless pride


00:11:43.077 --> 00:11:45.497
and a fierce desire
for recognition.


00:11:45.704 --> 00:11:47.748
She's a legitimate goddess.


00:11:47.790 --> 00:11:49.292
Huh? Are you sure?


00:11:49.501 --> 00:11:50.918
[XYLO] Dead sure.


00:11:50.960 --> 00:11:53.296
We're in the presence
of a goddess.


00:11:53.338 --> 00:11:57.551
Most likely the 13th one,
who has yet to be activated.


00:11:57.592 --> 00:12:00.303
I am the great goddess Teoritta,


00:12:00.345 --> 00:12:04.140
the guardian who bestows
blessings upon mankind!


00:12:04.182 --> 00:12:05.850
Teoritta.


00:12:06.267 --> 00:12:08.019
[TEORITTA] Speak, my knight.


00:12:08.061 --> 00:12:10.230
Put a word that what you seek.


00:12:10.522 --> 00:12:14.359
And I shall then lend form
to your prayer with great ease,


00:12:14.401 --> 00:12:17.070
for that
is my sole reason for being.


00:12:17.111 --> 00:12:18.196
[grunts]


00:12:18.530 --> 00:12:21.115
That's enough.
You know there's more.


00:12:21.199 --> 00:12:22.492
Don't be dumb.


00:12:22.534 --> 00:12:23.784
[Teoritta gasps]


00:12:23.826 --> 00:12:26.787
There's nothing I hate more
than a goddess.


00:12:26.829 --> 00:12:28.498
[horn blaring]


00:12:28.582 --> 00:12:29.790
Dotta.


00:12:29.832 --> 00:12:31.918
[XYLO] Hurry up,
find somewhere to hide her.


00:12:31.959 --> 00:12:33.127
[Dotta stammers]


00:12:33.169 --> 00:12:35.922
[XYLO] I refuse
to ask a goddess for help!


00:12:35.963 --> 00:12:37.840
[DOTTA]
What am I supposed to do?


00:12:37.882 --> 00:12:39.426
[♪ tense music playing]


00:12:46.391 --> 00:12:47.434
Dotta.


00:12:47.475 --> 00:12:49.436
Directions and distance
are on you.


00:12:49.477 --> 00:12:51.271
Where are they
most concentrated?


00:12:51.312 --> 00:12:53.814
[DOTTA] For the record,
I advise against this.


00:12:53.856 --> 00:12:55.024
[XYLO] I didn't ask!


00:12:55.066 --> 00:12:56.817
A good distraction
is the only way


00:12:56.859 --> 00:12:58.403
to support the retreat.


00:12:58.445 --> 00:12:59.738
Have it your way!


00:12:59.778 --> 00:13:01.197
You always do.


00:13:02.282 --> 00:13:04.242
- [knights grunt]
- [monsters growl]


00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:07.454
[groans]


00:13:07.621 --> 00:13:10.831
They're at ten o'clock!
One finger's width to nine.


00:13:11.416 --> 00:13:12.709
That way, huh?


00:13:12.751 --> 00:13:14.001
[TEORITTA] Fascinating.


00:13:14.294 --> 00:13:17.171
You diminutive squire
has excellent eyesight.


00:13:17.213 --> 00:13:19.424
The hell?
What are you doing here?


00:13:19.507 --> 00:13:21.342
[♪ dramatic music playing]


00:13:21.384 --> 00:13:22.427
[monster growls]


00:13:22.510 --> 00:13:25.012
Assisting.
For I am true to my word.


00:13:25.054 --> 00:13:26.931
My knight
shall taste sweet victory!


00:13:26.973 --> 00:13:28.600
I don't need your assistance!


00:13:29.476 --> 00:13:31.478
[monsters growl]


00:13:35.315 --> 00:13:36.566
[Teoritta gasps]


00:13:36.608 --> 00:13:39.611
- They will soon be upon us!
- Stay out of it!


00:13:43.156 --> 00:13:46.159
If you wanna help,
leave me alone!


00:13:54.751 --> 00:13:56.252
[Teoritta grunts]


00:13:58.338 --> 00:13:59.714
[gasps]


00:14:00.881 --> 00:14:02.592
[TEORITTA] What was that power?


00:14:02.634 --> 00:14:06.346
A sacred seal of heat and light.
Now stay here and hide yourself.


00:14:06.429 --> 00:14:08.097
[knight grunts in effort]


00:14:11.142 --> 00:14:14.061
We'll keep them occupied.
Hurry and--


00:14:15.188 --> 00:14:16.606
[monster growls]


00:14:17.898 --> 00:14:19.400
[Xylo grunts]


00:14:21.569 --> 00:14:22.737
[Dotta gasps]


00:14:23.279 --> 00:14:24.489
Ugh.


00:14:24.531 --> 00:14:26.574
- I think I'm gonna be sick.
- [XYLO] Dotta!


00:14:26.658 --> 00:14:29.202
There's no time to waste.
Get in there!


00:14:29.243 --> 00:14:30.829
Just keep firing.


00:14:32.288 --> 00:14:34.499
Sure.
I've just gotta prepare myself.


00:14:34.582 --> 00:14:35.667
[gasps]


00:14:37.627 --> 00:14:39.295
Hold on! I'm not ready!


00:14:46.678 --> 00:14:48.137
[gasps in awe]


00:14:48.346 --> 00:14:50.431
I hit it. That was amazing!


00:14:50.473 --> 00:14:52.350
And with just
an old thunder staff.


00:14:52.392 --> 00:14:55.186
Missing would be more impressive
with these numbers.


00:14:56.020 --> 00:14:59.898
Keep up the support fire,
and don't you dare hit me!


00:15:00.107 --> 00:15:01.192
[Teoritta pants]


00:15:01.234 --> 00:15:03.069
I am here, young squire!


00:15:03.110 --> 00:15:05.446
Worry not, for we shall prevail!


00:15:05.488 --> 00:15:07.699
Well,
the outlook's not promising.


00:15:07.741 --> 00:15:09.158
Oh, you look tired.


00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:11.536
So why don't you go ahead
and get some rest?


00:15:16.416 --> 00:15:17.625
[grunts]


00:15:17.751 --> 00:15:19.419
Those are the last survivors!


00:15:19.460 --> 00:15:21.212
- [XYLO] I'll get them.
- Huh?


00:15:27.009 --> 00:15:29.136
To hell with you!


00:15:35.852 --> 00:15:36.977
[grunts]


00:15:38.479 --> 00:15:39.731
[moans]


00:15:42.817 --> 00:15:44.151
[monster growls]


00:15:48.947 --> 00:15:51.534
Sorry, that was so close,
but it's harder to hit


00:15:51.576 --> 00:15:52.702
when I'm far away.


00:15:52.744 --> 00:15:54.036
Just keep it up!


00:15:54.287 --> 00:15:56.706
I'm going to finish them off!


00:15:56.748 --> 00:15:57.998
For real?


00:15:58.040 --> 00:16:00.418
[hesitates] Here I come!


00:16:01.461 --> 00:16:03.922
Take heart
in what I swore to you!


00:16:04.839 --> 00:16:06.633
Patience, my knight.


00:16:06.674 --> 00:16:08.927
[Teoritta grunts, pants]


00:16:12.680 --> 00:16:14.891
[owls coo]


00:16:14.933 --> 00:16:16.309
[insects chirping]


00:16:17.852 --> 00:16:20.104
[metal rattles]


00:16:21.188 --> 00:16:24.442
[XYLO] Ah, I see you survived.


00:16:26.152 --> 00:16:29.447
[KNIGHT 1] You saved us. And
I didn't expect reinforcements.


00:16:29.572 --> 00:16:32.325
[XYLO] Get out of here, quickly!


00:16:32.366 --> 00:16:33.868
But what of you?


00:16:34.076 --> 00:16:36.830
Wait! You are one
of those monstrous penal heroes.


00:16:36.871 --> 00:16:38.539
In our own midst?


00:16:38.581 --> 00:16:40.082
[KNIGHT 2] A capital offender?


00:16:40.124 --> 00:16:41.835
[KNIGHT 3]
What is he doing here?


00:16:41.876 --> 00:16:44.086
Saved by his kind...


00:16:44.295 --> 00:16:45.964
[Dotta and Teoritta pant]


00:16:49.592 --> 00:16:51.594
[DOTTA]
I don't like the looks of this.


00:16:53.721 --> 00:16:56.891
[XYLO] I have my orders.
So you can retreat already.


00:16:56.933 --> 00:16:58.893
A new horde is fast approaching.


00:16:58.935 --> 00:17:01.061
That call is not yours!


00:17:02.438 --> 00:17:04.440
Being saved
by a scoundrel like you


00:17:04.774 --> 00:17:06.192
tarnishes our honor!


00:17:08.026 --> 00:17:09.654
I'm a little confused.


00:17:09.737 --> 00:17:12.740
Shouldn't this be the part
where these guys thank us?


00:17:13.157 --> 00:17:15.242
That's how it goes for heroes.


00:17:15.284 --> 00:17:17.119
Now point that sword
somewhere else.


00:17:17.161 --> 00:17:19.372
Your intentions are clear,
my knight.


00:17:19.413 --> 00:17:22.458
It would be most ignoble
to abandon these lost souls.


00:17:22.625 --> 00:17:24.794
- [Xylo gasps]
- I see right through you.


00:17:24.836 --> 00:17:26.629
- [KNIGHT 4] Hold on.
- [Xylo gasps]


00:17:27.505 --> 00:17:30.591
Your glowing hair
and brilliant red eyes.


00:17:30.633 --> 00:17:33.260
You look like...


00:17:33.302 --> 00:17:35.930
What are lowlifes like you
doing with her?


00:17:35.972 --> 00:17:38.516
We gave her
to the transport team!


00:17:38.558 --> 00:17:39.976
[swords rattle]


00:17:42.729 --> 00:17:43.938
[sighs]


00:17:46.148 --> 00:17:47.567
Answer me!


00:17:48.651 --> 00:17:50.110
[XYLO] If I do,


00:17:50.236 --> 00:17:52.279
will you lower your swords?


00:17:52.822 --> 00:17:54.281
[Teoritta gasps softly]


00:17:55.449 --> 00:17:56.576
[sighs]


00:18:00.747 --> 00:18:02.540
Hey, take it easy!


00:18:02.582 --> 00:18:05.292
This is no time for squabbling
amongst ourselves.


00:18:05.334 --> 00:18:07.754
Another wave is coming.
We have to move quickly!


00:18:07.795 --> 00:18:08.838
[mic feedback]


00:18:08.880 --> 00:18:11.131
[MAN] Xylo! Dotta!
Can you hear me?


00:18:11.173 --> 00:18:13.718
Venetim, you need to warn us
before you do that!


00:18:13.760 --> 00:18:15.344
[VENETIM] We're in deep trouble.


00:18:15.386 --> 00:18:17.055
Everything's falling to pieces.


00:18:17.095 --> 00:18:18.472
It's a complete mess!


00:18:18.806 --> 00:18:19.933
Be more specific.


00:18:19.974 --> 00:18:21.976
You think everything
is a complete mess.


00:18:22.018 --> 00:18:23.978
[VENETIM]
I mean it! It's such a mess,


00:18:24.020 --> 00:18:25.939
It could spell the end
for all of us.


00:18:26.230 --> 00:18:27.941
Xylo, do you have a minute?


00:18:27.982 --> 00:18:29.107
[XYLO] Hell, no!


00:18:29.734 --> 00:18:31.527
- [monster growls]
- [thud]


00:18:33.571 --> 00:18:35.448
[XYLO]
I'm assuming you heard that.


00:18:35.489 --> 00:18:37.825
Still think I'm free to chat?


00:18:38.158 --> 00:18:40.661
[VENETIM] I'll admit
it sounds like a bad time.


00:18:40.703 --> 00:18:42.496
But if I don't tell you now,


00:18:42.538 --> 00:18:45.123
you'll absolutely be angry
at me later.


00:18:45.165 --> 00:18:46.500
[XYLO] Then spit it out!


00:18:46.667 --> 00:18:48.711
[VENETIM]
The Holy Knights' main force


00:18:48.753 --> 00:18:50.337
is currently
marching straight


00:18:50.379 --> 00:18:51.505
for the Demon Blight.


00:18:51.547 --> 00:18:52.715
[gasps]


00:18:53.424 --> 00:18:54.968
[insects chirping]


00:18:56.719 --> 00:18:59.388
[KNIGHT 1] Understood.
Report to the Temple at once.


00:18:59.430 --> 00:19:00.598
[KNIGHT 2] Sir!


00:19:01.599 --> 00:19:02.725
[background chatter]


00:19:02.767 --> 00:19:05.061
[XYLO] Venetim, say that again.


00:19:05.103 --> 00:19:06.562
[gasps]


00:19:06.646 --> 00:19:09.189
You'll be angry at me later
if I don't tell you now, so--


00:19:09.231 --> 00:19:11.525
- [XYLO] Not that! Next part!
- [mic feedback]


00:19:11.567 --> 00:19:13.820
[VENETIM] Right.
It appears the Holy Knights


00:19:13.861 --> 00:19:16.322
stationed in the forest
over there have regrouped.


00:19:16.363 --> 00:19:18.658
They're forming ranks,
and preparing for battle


00:19:18.699 --> 00:19:19.784
against the blight.


00:19:19.993 --> 00:19:21.744
Those soldiers
seem to be dead set


00:19:21.786 --> 00:19:23.955
on stopping it
from advancing any further.


00:19:23.997 --> 00:19:25.832
The hell?
What are they thinking?


00:19:25.873 --> 00:19:27.625
[VENETIM]
I obviously have no clue


00:19:27.667 --> 00:19:28.876
what's gotten into them.


00:19:28.918 --> 00:19:30.336
Hey!


00:19:30.377 --> 00:19:32.755
What's your captain playing at
with this last stand?


00:19:32.797 --> 00:19:34.924
You have a direct order
to retreat.


00:19:39.553 --> 00:19:41.388
Don't tell me.


00:19:41.848 --> 00:19:44.725
[XYLO] Was this your genius plan
from the outset?


00:19:44.767 --> 00:19:45.935
[grunts]


00:19:50.064 --> 00:19:53.693
[KNIGHT] That's right.
Captain Kivia gave us the order.


00:19:53.818 --> 00:19:56.904
Kivia?
That fool sent you to die.


00:19:56.946 --> 00:19:58.156
How dare you?


00:19:58.572 --> 00:20:01.617
Our captain
has our unwavering trust.


00:20:01.826 --> 00:20:03.619
We fight for the captain's honor


00:20:03.661 --> 00:20:05.788
and for that
of the Holy Knights.


00:20:05.955 --> 00:20:07.081
We would not hesitate


00:20:07.123 --> 00:20:09.375
to lay down our lives
for either.


00:20:11.794 --> 00:20:12.879
[Xylo chuckles]


00:20:12.920 --> 00:20:14.380
Pathetic.


00:20:15.464 --> 00:20:18.551
What do you think you'll achieve
in the state that you're in?


00:20:18.592 --> 00:20:21.470
[VENETIM] Um, going back
to what I was talking about.


00:20:21.512 --> 00:20:23.139
Whatever it is, say it already!


00:20:23.181 --> 00:20:25.683
[VENETIM] Shouldn't you
just rescue them?


00:20:25.725 --> 00:20:27.977
If over half
of the Holy Knights die,


00:20:28.019 --> 00:20:30.354
that's a failed mission
for the Hero Unit.


00:20:31.229 --> 00:20:32.815
You won't simply die.


00:20:32.857 --> 00:20:35.442
You might get resurrected
and burned at the stake.


00:20:35.484 --> 00:20:37.195
Regardless,
it will be painful


00:20:37.235 --> 00:20:38.779
and quite unpleasant.


00:20:39.197 --> 00:20:41.490
That sounds bad. What now, Xylo?


00:20:41.532 --> 00:20:44.160
[TEORITTA] Why has your heart
fallen to such despair?


00:20:44.202 --> 00:20:47.038
There can be no greater honor
than to save another soul


00:20:47.080 --> 00:20:48.206
from certain peril.


00:20:48.288 --> 00:20:49.749
Am I wrong, my knight?


00:20:49.790 --> 00:20:51.584
[XYLO] Quiet, both of you!


00:20:52.376 --> 00:20:55.213
Venetim. How far
have the dead men walking


00:20:55.253 --> 00:20:56.254
made it?


00:20:56.296 --> 00:20:58.966
[VENETIM]
Huh? Oh, uh, they, um--


00:20:59.008 --> 00:21:01.010
[XYLO]
You're just now looking into it?


00:21:01.052 --> 00:21:03.221
Of course not.
What do you take me for?


00:21:03.261 --> 00:21:06.348
I believe they've gathered
at the second crossing point


00:21:06.390 --> 00:21:07.892
along the Purcell River.


00:21:07.934 --> 00:21:09.602
Do whatever you can.


00:21:09.643 --> 00:21:11.729
The second crossing point.


00:21:11.771 --> 00:21:13.189
[♪ tense music playing]


00:21:13.231 --> 00:21:15.608
[XYLO] Don't even think
about joining up with them,


00:21:15.649 --> 00:21:17.944
unless
you want to be a hindrance.


00:21:18.527 --> 00:21:20.113
[KNIGHT] We made a choice.


00:21:20.154 --> 00:21:23.699
Vow to fight and die
alongside Captain Kivia.


00:21:23.741 --> 00:21:26.035
It's not something
a hero would understand.


00:21:26.077 --> 00:21:28.662
[XYLO]
Just head south and get lost.


00:21:29.163 --> 00:21:30.664
We drove back the faeries


00:21:30.706 --> 00:21:32.750
that were attacking
your flying column.


00:21:32.792 --> 00:21:33.876
You did?


00:21:34.085 --> 00:21:36.336
[XYLO] Retreat to the south end
of the forest,


00:21:36.378 --> 00:21:38.547
and you'll find the team
that oversees us.


00:21:38.714 --> 00:21:41.675
Give that ass Venetim
a black eye for me.


00:21:43.677 --> 00:21:44.887
I'll handle this.


00:21:44.929 --> 00:21:46.722
And then
give that captain of yours


00:21:46.764 --> 00:21:48.099
a piece of my mind.


00:21:48.641 --> 00:21:49.767
[grunts]


00:21:50.434 --> 00:21:52.561
You truly intend
to support our retreat


00:21:52.603 --> 00:21:53.896
and aid our captain?


00:21:54.521 --> 00:21:57.733
Hey, Dotta.
The mission isn't over yet.


00:21:57.775 --> 00:22:00.360
[DOTTA] Xylo! Are you serious?


00:22:00.569 --> 00:22:02.362
I'm afraid I am.


00:22:02.613 --> 00:22:04.698
We'll meet up
with the Holy Knights


00:22:04.740 --> 00:22:07.076
and prevent them
from being routed.


00:22:07.201 --> 00:22:08.368
[Dotta groans]


00:22:08.410 --> 00:22:11.080
My knight
is the very epitome of honor!


00:22:11.164 --> 00:22:14.041
I vote against it.
Can we talk about this?


00:22:14.083 --> 00:22:17.128
I know you wouldn't wanna die
for those Holy Knights, either.


00:22:17.170 --> 00:22:18.796
Especially since you said you--


00:22:18.838 --> 00:22:20.131
Are you done?


00:22:21.507 --> 00:22:23.634
If the choice was mine to make,


00:22:23.676 --> 00:22:26.553
I'd gladly
let those bastards die.


00:22:26.595 --> 00:22:29.265
I despise people
who throw their lives away.


00:22:29.307 --> 00:22:30.724
But I can't.


00:22:31.100 --> 00:22:33.186
If I let them die on my watch,


00:22:33.227 --> 00:22:35.313
they'll have cause
to look down on me,


00:22:35.353 --> 00:22:37.731
and that's one thing
I can't allow.


00:22:38.149 --> 00:22:39.692
Interesting logic.


00:22:39.984 --> 00:22:41.235
[XYLO] Let's go.


00:22:41.777 --> 00:22:44.488
If the Holy Knights
get slaughtered out there,


00:22:44.530 --> 00:22:46.657
we'll pay a steep price.


00:22:56.209 --> 00:22:57.960
[water splashes]


00:23:00.296 --> 00:23:02.256
[background chatter]


00:23:05.051 --> 00:23:07.385
[MAN 1] Get some nourishment
while you can.


00:23:08.346 --> 00:23:09.763
[gulping]


00:23:14.852 --> 00:23:16.354
[gasps]


00:23:16.394 --> 00:23:17.688
Enemy sighted!


00:23:17.730 --> 00:23:19.857
Form ranks now!


00:23:19.899 --> 00:23:21.317
[monster growls]


00:23:24.195 --> 00:23:26.446
Thunder staff squad, advance!


00:23:26.488 --> 00:23:28.574
[♪ tense music playing]


00:23:35.164 --> 00:23:37.333
[♪ dramatic music playing]


00:23:40.086 --> 00:23:41.712
[WOMAN] Prepare yourselves.


00:23:43.756 --> 00:23:46.424
We will hold
until the last moment!


00:23:50.554 --> 00:23:52.014
[knight pants]


00:24:02.524 --> 00:24:04.151
Fire!


00:24:14.328 --> 00:24:15.829
The first wave is down!


00:24:16.122 --> 00:24:18.207
But still,
there are way too many!


00:24:18.916 --> 00:24:20.626
They have trolls!


00:24:22.211 --> 00:24:23.670
[roars]


00:24:26.257 --> 00:24:28.134
Use the thunder ballistae.


00:24:28.301 --> 00:24:30.468
We cannot allow them
to cross the river!


00:24:34.348 --> 00:24:35.433
[metal thuds]


00:24:35.473 --> 00:24:37.059
[KNIGHT] Fire.


00:24:37.101 --> 00:24:38.644
[energy swishes]


00:24:39.603 --> 00:24:41.521
[charging buzz]


00:24:46.777 --> 00:24:48.821
[growls]


00:24:54.492 --> 00:24:56.287
[DOTTA]
They're in the thick of it.


00:24:56.329 --> 00:24:58.831
The Verkle Development
Corporation's assault team.


00:24:58.872 --> 00:25:00.416
They're strong, but won't have


00:25:00.458 --> 00:25:02.584
nearly enough ammunition
to pull this off.


00:25:02.668 --> 00:25:05.838
Xylo. Do you recognize
any of those knights?


00:25:07.006 --> 00:25:08.048
[XYLO] I don't,


00:25:08.341 --> 00:25:10.717
and I've never seen
that banner before.


00:25:10.801 --> 00:25:12.386
Then let's stay where we are.


00:25:12.428 --> 00:25:14.888
There's still a chance
they can tough it out.


00:25:14.930 --> 00:25:17.099
[TEORITTA]
Utter nonsense from Craven Lips.


00:25:17.766 --> 00:25:20.060
Does not your timid heart
crave glory?


00:25:20.102 --> 00:25:22.562
Nor wish to share
in its sweet nectar?


00:25:23.939 --> 00:25:25.316
Doesn't matter.


00:25:25.358 --> 00:25:27.901
They would never let us share
in their glory.


00:25:29.236 --> 00:25:30.779
[KNIGHT] Out of ammo!


00:25:30.988 --> 00:25:33.324
Captain,
the ballista isn't working.


00:25:33.491 --> 00:25:36.076
We'll have to revert
to standard weaponry.


00:25:36.118 --> 00:25:38.620
Use pikes to block
whatever's still moving!


00:25:38.871 --> 00:25:40.164
[knight grunts]


00:25:40.247 --> 00:25:41.832
[knights scream]


00:25:41.874 --> 00:25:43.876
[screams, grunts]


00:25:55.179 --> 00:25:57.931
The faeries will likely
send another unit around back


00:25:57.973 --> 00:25:59.016
to flank them.


00:25:59.058 --> 00:26:00.684
The demon lord
who's leading them


00:26:00.726 --> 00:26:03.645
is thinking strategically.
And that's the smart move.


00:26:03.854 --> 00:26:07.483
We should meet up with them
and devise a plan of att--


00:26:09.985 --> 00:26:12.029
Are you kidding me?


00:26:12.112 --> 00:26:13.697
Huh? He's gone.


00:26:13.739 --> 00:26:15.199
Guess I should have known.


00:26:15.241 --> 00:26:16.367
[Teoritta exhales]


00:26:21.539 --> 00:26:23.457
Did you misplace
your loyal squire?


00:26:23.499 --> 00:26:25.959
So it seems. And now,
he's proven he's nothing


00:26:26.001 --> 00:26:28.754
but a piece of garbage
who should never be trusted.


00:26:28.795 --> 00:26:30.297
I'll make him pay in blood.


00:26:30.423 --> 00:26:32.632
You finally see
that I am the only one worthy


00:26:32.674 --> 00:26:33.717
of your trust!


00:26:33.759 --> 00:26:35.969
You require a miracle,
do you not?


00:26:36.011 --> 00:26:38.847
I already told you.
I won't ask a goddess.


00:26:38.889 --> 00:26:40.766
[distant explosions]


00:26:43.727 --> 00:26:44.853
[XYLO] Shit!


00:26:45.062 --> 00:26:48.399
Hope my flight seal
is fast enough!


00:26:48.441 --> 00:26:50.192
[♪ tense music playing]


00:26:54.696 --> 00:26:56.156
[clicks tongue]


00:26:59.868 --> 00:27:01.954
[people screaming]


00:27:02.829 --> 00:27:04.290
Take this!


00:27:06.959 --> 00:27:08.919
Again!


00:27:08.961 --> 00:27:10.921
[♪ dramatic music playing]


00:27:15.426 --> 00:27:16.552
[knife clinks]


00:27:17.219 --> 00:27:18.345
[grunts]


00:27:21.639 --> 00:27:23.683
[knights grunt]


00:27:27.271 --> 00:27:29.231
[monsters shriek]


00:27:33.152 --> 00:27:34.652
[KNIGHT] Draw!


00:27:34.945 --> 00:27:36.905
Loose your arrows!


00:27:42.119 --> 00:27:43.703
[all gasp]


00:27:44.413 --> 00:27:46.748
[knights scream]


00:27:48.417 --> 00:27:49.793
[monsters shriek]


00:27:50.461 --> 00:27:52.045
[people screaming]


00:27:55.299 --> 00:27:56.467
[Xylo grunts]


00:28:01.013 --> 00:28:02.556
[woman grunts]


00:28:04.057 --> 00:28:05.559
[WOMAN] What is that?


00:28:05.809 --> 00:28:08.020
Is that everything you've got?


00:28:08.479 --> 00:28:10.397
Because if that's the case,


00:28:10.481 --> 00:28:12.650
this win's too damn easy!


00:28:13.233 --> 00:28:16.403
[XYLO] Die, die, die, die!


00:28:16.445 --> 00:28:18.447
Just die!


00:28:21.241 --> 00:28:22.493
[grunts]


00:28:24.828 --> 00:28:26.539
[Xylo pants]


00:28:38.884 --> 00:28:40.177
[spits]


00:28:47.267 --> 00:28:48.519
[horse neighs]


00:28:50.229 --> 00:28:51.480
Who are you?


00:28:51.564 --> 00:28:54.149
I'm guessing you're none other
than Captain Kivia.


00:28:54.191 --> 00:28:55.484
My knight!


00:28:56.235 --> 00:28:58.529
Why would you go
and leave me behind?


00:28:58.571 --> 00:29:00.822
My goddess?
What are you doing out here?


00:29:00.864 --> 00:29:02.866
We sent you off safely
to Galtuile!


00:29:02.908 --> 00:29:04.410
[XYLO] Calm yourself.


00:29:04.451 --> 00:29:06.537
[KIVIA] You.
Did you attack the transport?


00:29:06.579 --> 00:29:09.498
Why ever would I?
They're unharmed.


00:29:09.873 --> 00:29:12.710
[XYLO] None of this mess
is remotely my fault.


00:29:12.750 --> 00:29:13.835
In any case...


00:29:13.877 --> 00:29:14.920
[Teoritta gasps]


00:29:14.961 --> 00:29:17.256
I haven't made a pact yet.


00:29:18.131 --> 00:29:20.967
Speak, my knight.
What is the meaning of this?


00:29:21.009 --> 00:29:22.261
I told you,


00:29:22.302 --> 00:29:25.138
there's nothing I hate more
than a goddess.


00:29:26.640 --> 00:29:30.519
[XYLO] I'm not your knight.
Find someone else to cling to.


00:29:30.603 --> 00:29:31.937
[Teoritta sighs]


00:29:34.022 --> 00:29:35.148
[Kivia gasps]


00:29:35.608 --> 00:29:37.025
Explain yourself.


00:29:37.067 --> 00:29:39.695
Who exactly are you
and what are you doing here?


00:29:39.861 --> 00:29:42.322
While I'd love
to give you the rundown,


00:29:42.364 --> 00:29:45.033
not now.
There's no time to waste.


00:29:45.075 --> 00:29:46.368
[Kivia gasps]


00:29:48.120 --> 00:29:49.955
[XYLO] The demon lord.


00:29:51.582 --> 00:29:53.375
[♪ tense music playing]


00:29:58.589 --> 00:30:00.549
[grunts, growls]


00:30:01.717 --> 00:30:03.260
[birds caw]


00:30:05.178 --> 00:30:06.597
[shrieks]


00:30:11.977 --> 00:30:14.396
Seems it caught up to you.


00:30:14.438 --> 00:30:16.189
Number 47.


00:30:16.482 --> 00:30:18.442
There's no mistaking it.


00:30:19.652 --> 00:30:21.695
Awd Goggie.


00:30:22.488 --> 00:30:24.114
[grunts, shrieks]


00:30:27.075 --> 00:30:28.868
[wind blows]


00:30:37.961 --> 00:30:39.505
[♪ tense music playing]


00:30:39.588 --> 00:30:41.089
[monster shrieks]


00:30:41.799 --> 00:30:43.216
[growls]


00:30:47.513 --> 00:30:48.597
[gasps]


00:30:48.639 --> 00:30:49.682
Incoming!


00:30:49.723 --> 00:30:51.684
Don't let that thing
break through!


00:30:51.725 --> 00:30:53.560
[charging buzz]


00:30:55.228 --> 00:30:57.439
Wait! Hold your fire!


00:31:07.865 --> 00:31:09.702
[energy buzzes]


00:31:15.915 --> 00:31:17.959
[knights yell in terror]


00:31:25.634 --> 00:31:28.261
[XYLO] Shit!
It erected a force field.


00:31:28.303 --> 00:31:31.557
Now it can repel all the blasts.
It's a real tricky one.


00:31:31.598 --> 00:31:33.891
We're gonna have
to get up close to fight it.


00:31:34.142 --> 00:31:36.395
Don't you have
any battering rams or slings?


00:31:36.436 --> 00:31:38.980
They're still preparing them
in the First Capital.


00:31:39.022 --> 00:31:41.692
We'll have to hope
our scorched earth seals work.


00:31:41.775 --> 00:31:43.985
- [KIVIA] Engineers--
- [XYLO] Don't do it.


00:31:44.069 --> 00:31:46.071
You'll destroy
everything in sight,


00:31:46.112 --> 00:31:49.616
including the seal users
and every last one of us!


00:31:50.617 --> 00:31:52.077
[energy buzzes]


00:31:54.287 --> 00:31:55.873
[monsters growl]


00:32:00.669 --> 00:32:02.671
It's suicide to mount a defense!


00:32:02.713 --> 00:32:04.798
We should fall back
and head east.


00:32:09.261 --> 00:32:12.598
[KIVIA]
I will not waver. We fight!


00:32:12.639 --> 00:32:13.682
[gasps]


00:32:13.724 --> 00:32:15.100
Don't be foolish!


00:32:15.141 --> 00:32:17.977
Our only mission here
is to support your retreat!


00:32:19.271 --> 00:32:20.980
Is that what you're doing?


00:32:21.189 --> 00:32:22.232
[gasps]


00:32:22.274 --> 00:32:24.067
Are you a hero?


00:32:24.109 --> 00:32:26.486
I am. That a problem?


00:32:27.153 --> 00:32:30.449
High Command in Galtuile
has granted captains like me


00:32:30.490 --> 00:32:32.200
the right
to make the final call!


00:32:32.325 --> 00:32:34.578
As such,
I will lay down my very life


00:32:34.620 --> 00:32:35.662
in pursuit of honor!


00:32:35.704 --> 00:32:37.831
I don't care
about your damn honor!


00:32:37.873 --> 00:32:39.750
Honor is all that matters!


00:32:39.792 --> 00:32:40.876
[groans]


00:32:40.918 --> 00:32:42.502
[XYLO] I've heard enough.


00:32:42.544 --> 00:32:45.464
I don't know what's driving you
to do this, but don't you care


00:32:45.505 --> 00:32:47.591
that you're dragging us down
with you?


00:32:47.633 --> 00:32:50.093
Why should I care
about the life of a hero?


00:32:50.135 --> 00:32:52.970
You're scum. Too low
for even death's release.


00:32:53.012 --> 00:32:56.809
As for her, explain at once
why you have the goddess!


00:32:56.850 --> 00:32:58.644
He's my knight.


00:32:58.727 --> 00:33:00.729
Xylo guides my way.


00:33:02.105 --> 00:33:03.899
[KIVIA]
I ordered for the goddess


00:33:03.941 --> 00:33:06.984
to be sent to Galtuile,
knowing we would die here.


00:33:07.026 --> 00:33:09.780
To see that critical mission
through to the end!


00:33:09.863 --> 00:33:11.323
Yet now...


00:33:11.364 --> 00:33:12.825
[gasps]


00:33:12.866 --> 00:33:14.451
Hold on.


00:33:14.493 --> 00:33:16.119
You're Xylo?


00:33:16.328 --> 00:33:17.454
[gasps]


00:33:22.041 --> 00:33:23.293
It's here.


00:33:27.756 --> 00:33:30.007
- [Xylo gasps]
- [monster shrieks]


00:33:30.843 --> 00:33:33.010
[XYLO] This cannot be real.


00:33:35.180 --> 00:33:38.015
[♪ eerie music playing]


00:33:43.605 --> 00:33:44.815
Heads up!


00:33:44.857 --> 00:33:46.274
[people screaming]


00:33:51.321 --> 00:33:53.323
I need damage reports!


00:33:54.867 --> 00:33:56.618
Xylo! There!


00:33:57.285 --> 00:33:58.787
[monsters shriek]


00:33:59.036 --> 00:34:00.246
[people screaming]


00:34:00.288 --> 00:34:02.374
[KNIGHT 1]
What the hell are those things?


00:34:03.249 --> 00:34:04.877
[KNIGHT 2] No! Stay back!


00:34:06.127 --> 00:34:07.796
[man screaming]


00:34:10.131 --> 00:34:12.258
[people screaming
and grunting]


00:34:12.384 --> 00:34:13.886
It's a massacre!


00:34:17.514 --> 00:34:18.932
[monster growls]


00:34:20.767 --> 00:34:22.728
[people screaming]


00:34:24.563 --> 00:34:26.606
[growling, screaming]


00:34:30.694 --> 00:34:32.612
At any cost, hold!


00:34:32.654 --> 00:34:36.575
[KNIGHT 1] Dammit!
We can't take much more!


00:34:36.616 --> 00:34:38.243
- [Xylo grunts]
- [knife clinks]


00:34:39.036 --> 00:34:40.328
[explosion]


00:34:43.248 --> 00:34:45.042
Still two left.


00:34:46.752 --> 00:34:48.587
You need not worry!


00:34:49.086 --> 00:34:50.296
[monster roars]


00:34:50.338 --> 00:34:51.423
[grunts]


00:34:54.968 --> 00:34:56.302
[Xylo yells fiercely]


00:35:00.223 --> 00:35:01.600
[grunts]


00:35:01.767 --> 00:35:03.393
[monster growls]


00:35:07.439 --> 00:35:10.067
- Our luck ran out.
- What are you doing?


00:35:10.149 --> 00:35:11.610
[people screaming]


00:35:15.363 --> 00:35:17.407
[♪ dramatic music playing]


00:35:23.246 --> 00:35:24.539
[man screaming]


00:35:24.581 --> 00:35:26.123
[Xylo pants and grunts]


00:35:34.800 --> 00:35:36.551
[TEORITTA] My knight...


00:35:37.677 --> 00:35:40.889
you must rise.


00:35:42.181 --> 00:35:44.225
[grunts]


00:35:45.393 --> 00:35:47.144
The time has come


00:35:47.312 --> 00:35:50.107
for you to awaken my power.


00:35:54.569 --> 00:35:56.404
Should you refuse,


00:35:56.446 --> 00:36:00.742
every soul present
shall die a tragic death.


00:36:00.784 --> 00:36:02.077
[Xylo grunts]


00:36:02.619 --> 00:36:05.038
[XYLO] I guess we're screwed.


00:36:05.080 --> 00:36:07.164
I would rather die


00:36:07.457 --> 00:36:10.251
than ever trust a goddess again.


00:36:10.710 --> 00:36:12.211
[grunts]


00:36:14.798 --> 00:36:19.928
Kivia! Come claim your goddess!
Make the damn pact yourself!


00:36:21.596 --> 00:36:23.807
[XYLO] Kivia! Answer me!


00:36:23.849 --> 00:36:25.600
[♪ dramatic music playing]


00:36:25.851 --> 00:36:27.602
[people screaming]


00:36:33.108 --> 00:36:34.860
[panting]


00:36:35.027 --> 00:36:36.153
[metal thuds]


00:36:36.945 --> 00:36:38.030
[gasps]


00:36:38.237 --> 00:36:40.157
[screaming in terror]


00:36:42.951 --> 00:36:44.036
[grunts]


00:36:45.286 --> 00:36:46.538
[grunts]


00:36:46.705 --> 00:36:49.374
[Xylo pants]


00:36:49.415 --> 00:36:51.043
- [TEORITTA] Xylo.
- [Xylo gasps]


00:36:53.962 --> 00:36:56.297
[TEORITTA]
You are my chosen knight.


00:36:56.464 --> 00:36:57.716
Unless you act,


00:36:57.757 --> 00:37:00.886
many more precious lives
shall be lost.


00:37:02.804 --> 00:37:05.264
Do you find that acceptable?


00:37:06.766 --> 00:37:08.143
[XYLO] Be quiet.


00:37:08.434 --> 00:37:10.227
I'm trying to think.


00:37:12.605 --> 00:37:14.191
[TEORITTA] All is well.


00:37:14.774 --> 00:37:17.861
You may despise me
if your heart insists.


00:37:17.903 --> 00:37:21.364
And wish ill upon all goddesses.


00:37:21.406 --> 00:37:25.410
For it matters not!
Victory shall still be yours.


00:37:29.748 --> 00:37:31.791
[♪ dramatic music playing]


00:37:33.585 --> 00:37:35.420
[XYLO] Piece of shit!


00:37:36.755 --> 00:37:37.881
Do it!


00:37:37.923 --> 00:37:40.008
There's no other way
out of this.


00:37:41.218 --> 00:37:42.677
It shall be done.


00:37:42.886 --> 00:37:45.931
But first, such a divine pact
requires an offering.


00:37:46.014 --> 00:37:47.182
[grunts]


00:37:49.601 --> 00:37:51.436
[TEORITTA]
The price to be paid is--


00:37:51.477 --> 00:37:52.645
I'm aware.


00:37:56.649 --> 00:37:58.359
Did I guess right?


00:37:59.819 --> 00:38:03.156
Teoritta. Help me win.


00:38:03.198 --> 00:38:05.992
Xylo. Swear, now and forever,


00:38:06.034 --> 00:38:08.912
to exemplify the majesty
befitting my knight.


00:38:08.954 --> 00:38:10.997
[XYLO] I swear.
Just get on with it.


00:38:11.039 --> 00:38:12.415
Very well.


00:38:12.457 --> 00:38:13.833
Now, my knight.


00:38:13.875 --> 00:38:16.878
Rejoice! I grant you
the power of a goddess.


00:38:19.589 --> 00:38:21.549
[♪ dramatic music intensifies]


00:38:24.719 --> 00:38:26.888
And... there I go.


00:38:28.598 --> 00:38:29.849
[XYLO] Once again,


00:38:29.891 --> 00:38:32.351
I'm choosing
to throw my life away.


00:38:33.394 --> 00:38:34.520
[grunts]


00:38:35.730 --> 00:38:37.690
[TEORITTA]
The pact has been made.


00:38:37.732 --> 00:38:40.777
The veil of your mind
has been lifted for me.


00:38:42.779 --> 00:38:45.907
What manner of blessing
shall you request of me?


00:38:49.035 --> 00:38:52.038
[XYLO] That. And make it flashy.


00:38:52.705 --> 00:38:54.540
Time to drive them back.


00:38:55.041 --> 00:38:56.960
[TEORITTA] A valiant standoff.


00:38:57.002 --> 00:38:59.171
Your resolve is laudable.


00:38:59.671 --> 00:39:01.173
So be it.


00:39:01.298 --> 00:39:02.924
By the grace of my power,


00:39:03.008 --> 00:39:05.802
I shall gladly
offer you my blessing!


00:39:09.306 --> 00:39:10.932
Kneel down!


00:39:11.183 --> 00:39:14.686
Pray to the goddess of swords,
Teoritta!


00:39:14.769 --> 00:39:16.729
[♪ adventurous music playing]


00:39:25.822 --> 00:39:27.240
[monsters growl]


00:39:35.123 --> 00:39:36.373
[gasps]


00:39:41.921 --> 00:39:43.589
[indistinct chatter]


00:39:45.050 --> 00:39:47.093
I trust that was satisfactory.


00:39:47.219 --> 00:39:50.347
And now I give you permission
to praise my sublime power


00:39:50.387 --> 00:39:52.473
and worship me
as much as you please!


00:39:52.849 --> 00:39:54.184
[Xylo growls]


00:39:54.267 --> 00:39:56.728
[TEORITTA] Do you hear?
I've granted you permission.


00:39:56.769 --> 00:39:59.147
- Now, pat my head.
- [XYLO] Sorry.


00:39:59.898 --> 00:40:01.733
The mission comes first.


00:40:06.696 --> 00:40:09.574
And that means killing
every last one of them!


00:40:10.825 --> 00:40:12.285
[monster roars]


00:40:12.451 --> 00:40:14.579
[yells fiercely]


00:40:16.789 --> 00:40:17.874
[monster growling]


00:40:18.415 --> 00:40:20.626
- Keep them coming!
- [TEORITTA] With ease.


00:40:20.668 --> 00:40:23.296
Though I expect ample praise
when the deed is done.


00:40:23.338 --> 00:40:25.798
You'll have it
if we survive this!


00:40:28.051 --> 00:40:29.552
Here we go!


00:40:30.595 --> 00:40:32.013
[XYLO] Keep it up!


00:40:33.390 --> 00:40:35.641
More, more, more!


00:40:35.683 --> 00:40:37.185
Don't stop!


00:40:37.685 --> 00:40:39.771
[KIVIA] What's... happening?


00:40:39.938 --> 00:40:41.022
[Xylo scoffs]


00:40:41.064 --> 00:40:42.315
[XYLO] Still alive?


00:40:43.191 --> 00:40:46.111
Kivia! Once you've cleared out
the last of them,


00:40:46.152 --> 00:40:47.820
get the wounded to safety.


00:40:47.862 --> 00:40:50.073
You expect me
to follow your command?


00:40:50.115 --> 00:40:51.241
A disgusting hero who--


00:40:51.283 --> 00:40:53.618
It is your only hope
of survival!


00:40:53.659 --> 00:40:54.744
[gasps]


00:40:56.204 --> 00:40:58.415
[XYLO]
I don't intend to die here.


00:40:58.455 --> 00:41:01.209
Or care to watch you
and your knights perish.


00:41:01.709 --> 00:41:03.044
Meaning...


00:41:04.963 --> 00:41:07.424
I will kill the demon lord.


00:41:07.464 --> 00:41:08.633
[gasps]


00:41:08.716 --> 00:41:10.427
[XYLO] If we make it out alive,


00:41:10.969 --> 00:41:13.972
I'll accept any punishment
that you deem fit


00:41:14.013 --> 00:41:16.057
and answer all your questions.


00:41:16.599 --> 00:41:18.893
[TEORITTA] Xylo,
have you chosen at last


00:41:19.060 --> 00:41:20.645
to fight for honor's sake?


00:41:21.187 --> 00:41:24.107
You and those feckless knights
just won't stop going on


00:41:24.149 --> 00:41:25.775
about that crap, will you?


00:41:26.151 --> 00:41:28.361
Fighting for honor's sake.


00:41:28.861 --> 00:41:30.738
That's a fool's game!


00:41:30.822 --> 00:41:32.324
[swords clink]


00:41:32.489 --> 00:41:33.950
[gasps]


00:41:34.867 --> 00:41:36.369
[XYLO] My motive


00:41:37.120 --> 00:41:41.040
is my desire to inflict
unfathomable violence.


00:41:41.082 --> 00:41:42.959
Let's get on with it!


00:41:44.836 --> 00:41:46.921
[♪ tense music playing]


00:41:51.426 --> 00:41:54.179
- Don't let go.
- Presumptuous.


00:41:54.595 --> 00:41:58.224
It is my place to worry
about you fallible humans.


00:41:58.266 --> 00:42:00.059
[roars]


00:42:03.980 --> 00:42:06.858
[TEORITTA] Now, my knight,
shall I bestow my blessing?


00:42:06.899 --> 00:42:09.319
No, I'll say when!


00:42:16.075 --> 00:42:19.745
Why delay?
Do you dare underestimate me?


00:42:19.996 --> 00:42:22.874
Even a goddess
such as you has a limit.


00:42:22.915 --> 00:42:26.127
When you exhaust yourself,
your flames grow brighter.


00:42:26.211 --> 00:42:27.420
Perhaps.


00:42:28.129 --> 00:42:30.215
[XYLO] I forbid you
to die out there.


00:42:30.256 --> 00:42:32.509
You won't get a word of praise
for that.


00:42:32.549 --> 00:42:33.634
[Teoritta sighs]


00:42:33.885 --> 00:42:35.178
After all,


00:42:35.261 --> 00:42:37.430
a goddess
should leave the strategizing


00:42:37.472 --> 00:42:38.890
to her faithful knight!


00:42:38.931 --> 00:42:40.099
[roaring]


00:42:44.896 --> 00:42:48.233
[XYLO] I can do it.
I'll forge a path for us!


00:42:52.445 --> 00:42:54.113
[monster roars]


00:42:55.781 --> 00:42:57.492
That was most impressive.


00:42:57.534 --> 00:42:59.035
Now, it is my turn!


00:42:59.077 --> 00:43:00.619
Not yet!


00:43:00.661 --> 00:43:01.913
[fighting grunts]


00:43:03.664 --> 00:43:04.957
Xylo!


00:43:06.000 --> 00:43:07.752
[roars]


00:43:08.294 --> 00:43:10.755
Get ready!
We're cutting through!


00:43:16.094 --> 00:43:17.220
[Xylo grunts]


00:43:17.512 --> 00:43:19.680
My patience is waning!


00:43:19.722 --> 00:43:21.516
[XYLO] I said no!


00:43:27.146 --> 00:43:29.315
That's a demon lord?


00:43:30.149 --> 00:43:32.609
Naturally,
I'm above feelings of fear.


00:43:32.651 --> 00:43:35.196
Goddesses were created
to strike down demon lords.


00:43:35.238 --> 00:43:37.365
- Allow me to demonstrate.
- Almost.


00:43:37.656 --> 00:43:39.658
[XYLO] Just a bit longer.


00:43:41.202 --> 00:43:42.703
[monster shrieks]


00:43:46.082 --> 00:43:47.375
[Xylo yells fiercely]


00:43:50.044 --> 00:43:51.796
[♪ adventurous music playing]


00:43:51.837 --> 00:43:53.005
[groans]


00:44:00.138 --> 00:44:02.014
[yells]


00:44:09.814 --> 00:44:11.357
[shrieks]


00:44:12.858 --> 00:44:13.985
[scoffs]


00:44:14.152 --> 00:44:16.904
That's a lot of howling
over one measly leg!


00:44:19.449 --> 00:44:20.783
[shrieks]


00:44:23.495 --> 00:44:25.121
Come at me!


00:44:28.374 --> 00:44:30.793
Xylo.
We shall soon be surrounded!


00:44:30.960 --> 00:44:32.629
Allow me to help you now.


00:44:32.669 --> 00:44:35.256
Do it! Clear a path for me!


00:44:35.298 --> 00:44:37.425
Give it all you've got!


00:44:37.550 --> 00:44:41.137
[TEORITTA] It shall be done.
Behold my glory!


00:44:41.179 --> 00:44:42.972
[growls]


00:44:51.564 --> 00:44:53.358
- Next--
- Spare your words.


00:44:53.399 --> 00:44:55.692
Your mind is like an open book,
my knight.


00:44:55.818 --> 00:44:56.986
Can you?


00:44:58.946 --> 00:45:00.198
Yes!


00:45:00.781 --> 00:45:03.075
I am a goddess, am I not?


00:45:03.368 --> 00:45:06.703
Now pray to me, with devotion!


00:45:11.959 --> 00:45:13.252
[XYLO] Perfect.


00:45:15.880 --> 00:45:19.050
That is exactly
what I was praying for!


00:45:22.261 --> 00:45:23.762
[fast blow]


00:45:25.097 --> 00:45:26.641
To hell with you,


00:45:26.765 --> 00:45:29.894
you damn cockroach!


00:45:36.192 --> 00:45:38.110
[monster groans]


00:45:43.199 --> 00:45:44.950
[Xylo grunts]


00:45:49.872 --> 00:45:51.583
[groans]


00:45:54.210 --> 00:45:55.794
See, my knight?


00:45:55.836 --> 00:45:57.922
I did. Now let's--


00:45:59.756 --> 00:46:01.300
[shrieks]


00:46:02.510 --> 00:46:03.844
Teoritta!


00:46:04.345 --> 00:46:05.762
[thud]


00:46:07.223 --> 00:46:09.684
[TEORITTA] Xylo! Xylo!


00:46:10.101 --> 00:46:11.352
Xylo!


00:46:12.061 --> 00:46:13.229
Xylo!


00:46:13.730 --> 00:46:14.939
[groans]


00:46:16.190 --> 00:46:17.983
[TEORITTA]
You're gravely injured,


00:46:18.025 --> 00:46:19.985
and all because
you were protecting me!


00:46:20.069 --> 00:46:21.195
[gasps]


00:46:25.450 --> 00:46:27.034
[monsters growl]


00:46:28.869 --> 00:46:30.871
My knight! Do you live?


00:46:30.913 --> 00:46:32.373
You will stay with me!


00:46:32.415 --> 00:46:34.584
[DOTTA] Uh... Xylo?


00:46:35.460 --> 00:46:37.712
Huh?


00:46:37.754 --> 00:46:40.339
What are you doing
in the middle of all this?


00:46:42.174 --> 00:46:43.301
[gasps]


00:46:46.011 --> 00:46:48.139
[XYLO] A scorched earth seal.


00:46:48.640 --> 00:46:50.600
[coughs]


00:46:51.726 --> 00:46:53.269
You punk!


00:46:53.519 --> 00:46:54.646
[Dotta grunts]


00:46:55.020 --> 00:46:57.273
You're out stealing again!


00:46:57.315 --> 00:46:59.150
Whoa, whoa,
it's not what you think!


00:46:59.191 --> 00:47:03.112
I, uh. went to the camp,
and it was lying there, so...


00:47:03.446 --> 00:47:04.947
You're lucky this time.


00:47:04.989 --> 00:47:06.907
I'd rather thank you
than kill you.


00:47:07.116 --> 00:47:09.160
[♪ adventurous music playing]


00:47:12.079 --> 00:47:13.456
And... what are you doing?


00:47:13.498 --> 00:47:15.792
Look at the dial
in the shape of the grooves.


00:47:15.832 --> 00:47:17.794
They let you choose
how it blows.


00:47:18.419 --> 00:47:21.339
I'm just glad
it's a model I recognize.


00:47:21.380 --> 00:47:23.215
Great. So what's next?


00:47:23.257 --> 00:47:26.302
Gonna give the big guy
more than he bargained for!


00:47:28.845 --> 00:47:32.057
Let's see how well
you deal with this one!


00:47:33.976 --> 00:47:35.436
- Did you--
- We're off!


00:47:35.478 --> 00:47:36.895
[Dotta and Teoritta grunt]


00:47:38.897 --> 00:47:40.650
[charging buzz]


00:48:02.879 --> 00:48:04.757
[birds chirping]


00:48:17.645 --> 00:48:19.146
How in the... ?


00:48:19.772 --> 00:48:21.106
Is it over?


00:48:23.067 --> 00:48:25.236
[TEORITTA] The faerie forces
are withdrawing.


00:48:25.277 --> 00:48:28.406
[XYLO] That always happens
as the Demon Blight fades.


00:48:28.447 --> 00:48:31.116
I've beaten enough demon lords
to know.


00:48:31.492 --> 00:48:33.452
I'd say
that's gotta be the dumbest way


00:48:33.494 --> 00:48:35.204
I ever made it happen, though.


00:48:35.246 --> 00:48:38.165
Dotta. I'll hand it to him
and his sticky fingers


00:48:38.207 --> 00:48:39.333
for saving the day.


00:48:39.375 --> 00:48:41.335
I'll buy him a drink
when he wakes up.


00:48:41.377 --> 00:48:42.670
[TEORITTA] My knight.


00:48:44.088 --> 00:48:47.550
You were brilliant!
A fierce and fearsome combatant.


00:48:47.592 --> 00:48:49.844
The day is ours.
A victory achieved


00:48:49.886 --> 00:48:52.263
through the grace of the goddess
at your side.


00:48:52.471 --> 00:48:55.558
Surely you must feel satisfied
by my abilities!


00:48:58.060 --> 00:48:59.395
[XYLO] I guess.


00:48:59.562 --> 00:49:01.647
[TEORITTA] Well, then.
[clears throat]


00:49:02.981 --> 00:49:04.191
[sighs]


00:49:06.151 --> 00:49:07.612
In that case,


00:49:07.653 --> 00:49:10.239
is it not fitting to praise
one who has done so well?


00:49:11.115 --> 00:49:12.450
Very well.


00:49:13.200 --> 00:49:14.911
Good job surviving.


00:49:14.951 --> 00:49:17.705
[TEORITTA] I was not expecting
praise of that sort.


00:49:17.747 --> 00:49:19.956
Is survival alone truly enough?


00:49:21.166 --> 00:49:23.168
[XYLO] It's more than enough.


00:49:24.044 --> 00:49:25.463
Take my word.


00:49:25.630 --> 00:49:26.963
[gasps]


00:49:27.005 --> 00:49:28.215
And yet,


00:49:29.007 --> 00:49:32.344
should a goddess
not be held to higher standards?


00:49:32.428 --> 00:49:34.931
What? Don't ask me.


00:49:34.971 --> 00:49:36.808
I don't get to decide.


00:49:37.974 --> 00:49:39.811
I suppose you don't.


00:49:41.729 --> 00:49:43.105
Although,


00:49:43.147 --> 00:49:45.817
I went above and beyond
mere survival!


00:49:45.858 --> 00:49:47.359
I met your expectations


00:49:47.401 --> 00:49:49.487
and managed
to slay a demon lord as well!


00:49:49.528 --> 00:49:50.987
An accomplishment
I would say


00:49:51.029 --> 00:49:52.657
very few could achieve!


00:49:53.407 --> 00:49:54.575
Agreed.


00:49:54.617 --> 00:49:55.785
[Teoritta chuckles]


00:49:55.827 --> 00:49:58.162
Do go on!
You have my leave to praise me


00:49:58.203 --> 00:49:59.789
as much as you may desire!


00:49:59.831 --> 00:50:02.166
Come now,
there's no need to hold back!


00:50:02.207 --> 00:50:04.710
Look,
I am prepared for my laurels!


00:50:04.752 --> 00:50:06.295
You may proceed as you see fit!


00:50:06.337 --> 00:50:07.379
[laughs]


00:50:07.463 --> 00:50:10.090
Go on, my knight!
Show me I did well!


00:50:10.132 --> 00:50:12.593
All right. I get it.


00:50:22.687 --> 00:50:25.147
[KIVIA] I found you, at last.


00:50:25.189 --> 00:50:26.398
I knew it.


00:50:26.565 --> 00:50:28.901
You truly are Xylo Forbartz.


00:50:29.276 --> 00:50:31.904
This one on the ground
is Dotta Luzulas.


00:50:33.614 --> 00:50:34.699
So...


00:50:35.073 --> 00:50:37.159
you stole a goddess
in transport,


00:50:37.201 --> 00:50:38.828
took a scorched earth seal


00:50:38.911 --> 00:50:41.079
and slew a demon lord
outside orders.


00:50:41.121 --> 00:50:44.040
You criminals
are the lowest of the low!


00:50:44.082 --> 00:50:45.125
[Xylo grunts]


00:50:45.167 --> 00:50:46.418
Guess we are.


00:50:46.460 --> 00:50:47.962
Goddess Teoritta.


00:50:48.004 --> 00:50:49.421
You have been deceived.


00:50:49.463 --> 00:50:51.883
We had the Thirteenth Order
of the Holy Knights


00:50:51.924 --> 00:50:54.426
intended to deliver you
to Galtuile Fortress.


00:50:55.011 --> 00:50:58.138
I was certain the transport team
already set out.


00:50:58.931 --> 00:51:00.098
[grunts]


00:51:01.809 --> 00:51:04.478
But this hero
has stolen you from them!


00:51:04.645 --> 00:51:06.981
Then made a pact with you
without permission!


00:51:07.189 --> 00:51:10.401
This Xylo Forbartz,
this man is a villain!


00:51:10.985 --> 00:51:12.277
Is he, now?


00:51:12.611 --> 00:51:15.907
Well then, that's where destiny
has taken me.


00:51:16.032 --> 00:51:17.115
[gasps]


00:51:17.157 --> 00:51:18.701
[TEORITTA] He is my knight.


00:51:19.869 --> 00:51:22.246
And no matter
what you may think,


00:51:22.287 --> 00:51:24.540
I choose to believe in Xylo.


00:51:24.707 --> 00:51:28.920
By his sword,
all demon lords shall be felled.


00:51:29.085 --> 00:51:32.214
He is the knight
who I find worthy of my grace.


00:51:34.592 --> 00:51:36.635
[KIVIA] I beg you to listen.


00:51:36.844 --> 00:51:41.015
You say that if you do not know
the crime he has committed.


00:51:41.223 --> 00:51:42.349
That's true.


00:51:42.391 --> 00:51:44.769
But what crime
could sway my heart?


00:51:45.019 --> 00:51:46.520
He killed a goddess.


00:51:46.562 --> 00:51:47.646
[gasps]


00:51:47.688 --> 00:51:49.941
Look upon a fallen Holy Knight!


00:51:50.232 --> 00:51:52.860
He once made a pact
with a goddess


00:51:53.861 --> 00:51:56.697
and cut her down
with his own hand!


00:52:09.710 --> 00:52:11.295
[indistinct chatter]


00:52:17.760 --> 00:52:19.053
[man clears throat]


00:52:19.135 --> 00:52:21.388
[MAN 1]
Defendant, Xylo Forbartz,


00:52:21.430 --> 00:52:23.348
Captain
of the Federated Kingdoms,


00:52:23.390 --> 00:52:25.559
Fifth Order of the Holy Knights.


00:52:25.601 --> 00:52:28.437
You were seen on the night
before the incident,


00:52:28.479 --> 00:52:30.815
leading your unit
in a supposed path


00:52:30.856 --> 00:52:33.567
meant to intercept
the 11th demon lord.


00:52:33.901 --> 00:52:36.278
Just before dawn,
you entered battle


00:52:36.320 --> 00:52:38.990
alongside
your pacted goddess Senerva.


00:52:39.031 --> 00:52:41.617
Do you have any objection
to these statements?


00:52:43.702 --> 00:52:45.329
They are all true.


00:52:46.162 --> 00:52:47.456
[MAN 2] He's guilty.


00:52:47.498 --> 00:52:48.833
[XYLO] Indeed.


00:52:48.916 --> 00:52:52.962
I did engage in combat
with the 11th demon lord.


00:52:53.004 --> 00:52:54.505
It was brutal.


00:52:54.588 --> 00:52:57.008
I was expecting
reinforcements to arrive,


00:52:57.049 --> 00:52:58.467
but they never showed up.


00:52:58.843 --> 00:53:02.178
[MAN 1] Only answer
the questions you are asked.


00:53:02.847 --> 00:53:06.391
Reports say the defendant
suffered catastrophic losses


00:53:06.433 --> 00:53:08.936
to his unit,
and that he used his goddess


00:53:08.978 --> 00:53:10.562
without leave to do so.


00:53:10.604 --> 00:53:12.356
Do you object to this report?


00:53:12.397 --> 00:53:13.565
I object!


00:53:13.732 --> 00:53:14.859
I was ordered.


00:53:14.900 --> 00:53:16.694
Everything was done
with permission.


00:53:16.735 --> 00:53:18.988
[MAN 1] We've already examined
the records


00:53:19.030 --> 00:53:22.449
from Galtuile Fortress.
There was no such order.


00:53:22.491 --> 00:53:23.868
[XYLO] You're lying.


00:53:24.118 --> 00:53:26.537
We had official orders
to go there.


00:53:26.620 --> 00:53:28.122
The message clearly stated


00:53:28.164 --> 00:53:31.000
that Uthob City
Defense Force Unit 71--


00:53:31.042 --> 00:53:34.128
[MAN 1] No such unit exists
in any of our records.


00:53:34.210 --> 00:53:36.881
You forced your men
to walk to their deaths


00:53:36.922 --> 00:53:39.633
thinking only of selfish glory
and not of their--


00:53:39.675 --> 00:53:40.801
[XYLO] You're wrong!


00:53:40.843 --> 00:53:42.553
[MAN 1]
Your unit has a reputation


00:53:42.594 --> 00:53:44.847
for its callous disregard
for authority.


00:53:44.889 --> 00:53:47.099
I have also heard
of illegal activity


00:53:47.141 --> 00:53:48.767
committed while dispatched.


00:53:48.809 --> 00:53:50.394
We're on a battlefield!


00:53:50.435 --> 00:53:52.730
A captain has to trust
his own judgement!


00:53:52.771 --> 00:53:54.314
We're granted that authority.


00:53:54.356 --> 00:53:56.025
[MAN 1]
An authority you only have


00:53:56.067 --> 00:53:59.028
thanks to the Federated Kingdom.
Yet, still...


00:53:59.070 --> 00:54:01.363
the worst of your crimes by far


00:54:01.780 --> 00:54:04.742
is your murder
of the goddess Senerva.


00:54:05.201 --> 00:54:07.578
Do you have any objections?


00:54:07.703 --> 00:54:08.996
[grunts]
[chain clinks]


00:54:10.288 --> 00:54:12.541
[XYLO] That one is true.


00:54:12.583 --> 00:54:13.792
[MAN 2] Impossible!


00:54:13.834 --> 00:54:15.753
[MAN 3] He killed
his own pacted goddess?


00:54:15.794 --> 00:54:17.421
[MAN 4] He's lower than a beast!


00:54:17.462 --> 00:54:18.547
[MAN 5] Goddess killer!


00:54:18.589 --> 00:54:20.340
[MAN 6] He should be slain!


00:54:20.382 --> 00:54:22.009
[MAN 7]
Death's too good for him!


00:54:22.051 --> 00:54:23.259
[WOMAN 1] Despicable!


00:54:23.969 --> 00:54:27.014
If there had been another way,
I would have taken it!


00:54:27.639 --> 00:54:30.768
We couldn't locate the team
we were ordered to rescue.


00:54:30.809 --> 00:54:33.562
The reinforcements we expected
never came.


00:54:33.604 --> 00:54:35.147
We were left out there to die!


00:54:35.189 --> 00:54:37.233
[MAN 1]
There were no reinforcements.


00:54:37.399 --> 00:54:39.735
How could there be
when you made everything up?


00:54:39.777 --> 00:54:41.779
There were no orders
for this mission.


00:54:41.820 --> 00:54:42.947
Liar!


00:54:43.239 --> 00:54:44.364
[chain clinks]


00:54:46.117 --> 00:54:47.701
[XYLO] Senerva...


00:54:47.952 --> 00:54:49.285
the goddess.


00:54:49.453 --> 00:54:52.372
All she wanted was praise
for helping our team.


00:54:52.706 --> 00:54:55.000
She fought
with all that she had.


00:54:55.042 --> 00:54:57.586
Asking for nothing
but words of comfort.


00:54:57.628 --> 00:54:59.004
[♪ sad music playing]


00:54:59.046 --> 00:55:00.380
In the end,


00:55:01.090 --> 00:55:03.926
she exhausted
the last of her power.


00:55:06.344 --> 00:55:08.222
She was past her limit.


00:55:08.513 --> 00:55:09.681
And so...


00:55:10.599 --> 00:55:11.767
I...


00:55:14.728 --> 00:55:17.273
[Xylo pants]


00:55:17.313 --> 00:55:18.690
[Senerva chuckles lightly]


00:55:19.275 --> 00:55:20.609
[Xylo whimpers]


00:55:21.902 --> 00:55:23.195
[Xylo yells]


00:55:24.029 --> 00:55:25.197
[chain rattles]


00:55:31.745 --> 00:55:35.373
[XYLO] Do you know what happens
when a goddess loses her power?


00:55:36.667 --> 00:55:39.461
She becomes weak
and defenseless.


00:55:40.004 --> 00:55:41.213
And then,


00:55:41.588 --> 00:55:44.508
the Demon Blight
begins to corrupt her.


00:55:45.926 --> 00:55:48.428
[MAN 1] There is no record
of this phenomenon


00:55:48.470 --> 00:55:51.015
ever occurring.
The Temple roundly rejects it


00:55:51.056 --> 00:55:52.348
as a possibility.


00:55:52.390 --> 00:55:53.767
More likely,


00:55:53.809 --> 00:55:56.854
you carved an excess
of sacred seals into yourself


00:55:56.895 --> 00:55:58.689
and went into a mindless rage.


00:55:58.730 --> 00:55:59.898
[XYLO] What?


00:55:59.940 --> 00:56:01.942
Would I still be here
if that happened?


00:56:01.984 --> 00:56:03.610
I'm telling the truth!


00:56:04.236 --> 00:56:06.905
[MAN 1] A goddess
being taken by the blight?


00:56:06.947 --> 00:56:07.990
How absurd!


00:56:08.032 --> 00:56:09.574
Just listen to me.


00:56:09.616 --> 00:56:12.328
I could not allow a goddess
to be corrupted by the blight.


00:56:12.368 --> 00:56:13.704
She'd wreak havoc!


00:56:13.745 --> 00:56:16.372
How could we possibly stand
against a demon lord


00:56:16.414 --> 00:56:19.793
wielding the unbridled power
of a goddess as their own?


00:56:22.796 --> 00:56:24.215
And Senerva.


00:56:24.506 --> 00:56:26.050
She understood...


00:56:26.550 --> 00:56:29.345
the corruption
had already begun.


00:56:29.385 --> 00:56:30.846
That's why...


00:56:31.305 --> 00:56:33.057
I had to kill her.


00:56:35.184 --> 00:56:36.685
[MAN 8] Lord Confessor.


00:56:36.727 --> 00:56:39.021
The defendant
continues to blaspheme


00:56:39.063 --> 00:56:41.481
a sacred goddess
with each word he utters.


00:56:41.523 --> 00:56:44.360
We have ascertained
all that we could need to know.


00:56:44.400 --> 00:56:47.321
I recommend
disallowing further speech.


00:56:47.363 --> 00:56:49.114
[MAN 1] Perhaps you're right.


00:56:49.156 --> 00:56:51.533
No. Hold on.
Aren't you listening?


00:56:51.575 --> 00:56:53.535
Don't you see
what you're risking here?


00:56:53.618 --> 00:56:57.331
You can't put blind faith
in the Temple or the military!


00:56:57.748 --> 00:56:58.916
[groans]


00:56:59.791 --> 00:57:01.752
You have to find them soon.


00:57:01.919 --> 00:57:04.629
If you don't act fast,
it'll be too late, and...


00:57:04.713 --> 00:57:06.006
[gasping]


00:57:06.173 --> 00:57:08.675
[people screaming]


00:57:08.967 --> 00:57:10.552
[XYLO] I see now.


00:57:11.970 --> 00:57:15.891
From the beginning,
this was nothing but a setup.


00:57:17.642 --> 00:57:19.770
You! All of you!


00:57:20.271 --> 00:57:22.522
[punches]


00:57:26.818 --> 00:57:28.820
[XYLO] I will find you,


00:57:29.738 --> 00:57:31.407
whomever you are.


00:57:32.408 --> 00:57:34.618
I will find you,


00:57:35.994 --> 00:57:37.579
both for me


00:57:37.788 --> 00:57:39.957
and my knights you doomed!


00:57:40.291 --> 00:57:41.708
I'll find you


00:57:41.917 --> 00:57:45.087
the one who was responsible
for Senerva's fate.


00:57:45.129 --> 00:57:46.797
[LORD CONFESSOR] Xylo Forbartz.


00:57:46.838 --> 00:57:48.299
I'll find you...


00:57:48.340 --> 00:57:50.301
[LORD CONFESSOR]
...to serve as a hero.


00:57:50.342 --> 00:57:51.885
[XYLO] And I will kill you!

